@startuml
' State diagram: a sale at the counter - Inventory & POS System v0.18.2 (report, Lecture 5)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

[*] --> EmptyBasket
EmptyBasket : nothing to pay
EmptyBasket --> Building : add product
Building : basket has lines
Building --> Building : add / remove line
Building --> EmptyBasket : remove last line / log out
Building --> Paying : choose Cash or GCash
Paying : typing cash or reference
Paying --> Building : add or remove a line
Paying --> Checking : Complete Sale
Checking : check stock, ingredients, payment
Checking --> Paying : payment refused
Checking --> Building : stock / ingredient short
Checking --> Saving : all fine
Saving : one database transaction
Saving --> Building : another till sold it (rolled back)
Saving --> Completed : committed
Completed : receipt shown, basket empty
Completed --> EmptyBasket : Start New Sale
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
